{"3876710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pigeon: A Love Story", "steam_appid": 3876710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5026600], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/c7b462407001b12dd55e56428f456258.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/c7b462407001b12dd55e56428f456258.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/c7b462407001b12dd55e56428f456258.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pigeon: A Love Story</i> is a game where you soar across to-scale replicas of iconic cities in search of your pigeon-shaped soulmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a slow game for fast times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE-SIZE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through full-scale maps of London, New York, Tokyo, Paris and Amsterdam: every building, every street, and every pigeon (we did the math).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/7c2fc4cae08c91996e7df3794b8e46ef.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/7c2fc4cae08c91996e7df3794b8e46ef.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/7c2fc4cae08c91996e7df3794b8e46ef.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIGEON-SIM™ TECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of thousands of autonomous pigeon NPCs flying and interacting in a real-time, city-wide simulation. Call out to as many as you can: most will politely reject you, but some may give you the occasional clue.  One of them, somewhere, is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/09a845ff9b8e64c126d9a6d6feee3750.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/09a845ff9b8e64c126d9a6d6feee3750.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/09a845ff9b8e64c126d9a6d6feee3750.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &quot;COO&quot;-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to eight friends across two different multiplayer modes: in one you must try to find each other, and in the other you must compete to see who can find their pigeon soulmate first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game play itself, screensaver style, if you just feel like birdwatching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/920194c3bf354909bc443948c55a9c5b.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/920194c3bf354909bc443948c55a9c5b.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/920194c3bf354909bc443948c55a9c5b.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEAK-TO-COO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional. Coo into your microphone to call out in-game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock in and zen out to a  soundtrack composed specifically for the game by <strong>Madwreck.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fce69bd43a23d4cc61d4bf32a48054e6.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fce69bd43a23d4cc61d4bf32a48054e6.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fce69bd43a23d4cc61d4bf32a48054e6.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/c7b462407001b12dd55e56428f456258.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/c7b462407001b12dd55e56428f456258.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/c7b462407001b12dd55e56428f456258.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pigeon: A Love Story</i> is a game where you soar across to-scale replicas of iconic cities in search of your pigeon-shaped soulmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a slow game for fast times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE-SIZE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through full-scale maps of London, New York, Tokyo, Paris and Amsterdam: every building, every street, and every pigeon (we did the math).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/7c2fc4cae08c91996e7df3794b8e46ef.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/7c2fc4cae08c91996e7df3794b8e46ef.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/7c2fc4cae08c91996e7df3794b8e46ef.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIGEON-SIM™ TECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of thousands of autonomous pigeon NPCs flying and interacting in a real-time, city-wide simulation. Call out to as many as you can: most will politely reject you, but some may give you the occasional clue.  One of them, somewhere, is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/09a845ff9b8e64c126d9a6d6feee3750.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/09a845ff9b8e64c126d9a6d6feee3750.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/09a845ff9b8e64c126d9a6d6feee3750.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &quot;COO&quot;-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to eight friends across two different multiplayer modes: in one you must try to find each other, and in the other you must compete to see who can find their pigeon soulmate first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game play itself, screensaver style, if you just feel like birdwatching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/920194c3bf354909bc443948c55a9c5b.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/920194c3bf354909bc443948c55a9c5b.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/920194c3bf354909bc443948c55a9c5b.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEAK-TO-COO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional. Coo into your microphone to call out in-game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock in and zen out to a  soundtrack composed specifically for the game by <strong>Madwreck.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fce69bd43a23d4cc61d4bf32a48054e6.poster.avif?t=1787429708\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fce69bd43a23d4cc61d4bf32a48054e6.webm?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fce69bd43a23d4cc61d4bf32a48054e6.mp4?t=1787429708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Soar over life-size, to-scale cities in this nee